fixtures/vectors/oracle.json
  Read-only responses of NEAR mainnet aggregate-oracle.near (public chain data).

fixtures/signer/v1-signer-eddsa-sign.json
  Read-only records of a third party's NEAR mainnet v1.signer sign request, its
  response and derived_public_key views (public chain data). Provenance in
  fixtures/signer/v1-signer-eddsa-sign.provenance.json.

fixtures/wallets/near-connect.json
  Wallet entries (names, descriptions, icon and website URLs, features,
  permissions) from the NEAR Connect wallet manifest,
  https://github.com/hot-dao/near-selector at commit
  9cee11c04cfd42f5a420688f808d4aca612b5fde (repository/manifest.json), with each
  adapter URL replaced by its commit-pinned raw file and that file's sha256. The
  package declares the MIT License in its npm metadata; the repository has no
  LICENSE file. The wallet adapters themselves are not in this repository: the
  console fetches a chosen wallet's pinned adapter at run time.

@hot-labs/near-connect 0.11.4 (inlined into the generated owner console page)
  NEAR Connect wallet connector by HOT Labs, https://github.com/hot-dao/near-selector,
  installed from npm through tools/package-lock.json and inlined unmodified into
  out/console/index.html, except that the console's loader replaces its
  IndexedDB cache module and supplies its fetch. MIT License as declared in the
  package's npm metadata.

fixtures/model/normal.json, fixtures/model/injection.json
  Genuine outputs of the Anthropic model claude-haiku-5-5, recorded by the
  repository author through the Claude Code CLI; prompts generated by this
  repository. Provenance and hashes in fixtures/manifest.json.

